1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,680
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,520
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,960
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,680
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,280
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:13,560
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,320
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,040
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,680
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,360
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,040
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,720
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:27,240
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,320
=Episode 8=

17
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,280
(Sun Ye)

18
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:44,679
Hello?

19
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,159
I'll take the fight.

20
00:00:47,439 --> 00:00:48,240
See you in a bit.

21
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:24,200
There you are.

22
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,439
Darn.

23
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:30,439
Wait, wait, wait!

24
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:33,560
Huh?

25
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,040
Y-you...

26
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:37,239
Did you just crawl out of
some woman's bed?

27
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,079
Can you still fight?

28
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,120
Just need to warm up.

29
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:45,980
Hey.

30
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:46,879
Bao.

31
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:51,120
He's my student.

32
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
Hasn't fought in five years.

33
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,439
He's here to shake off the rust

34
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,159
and make some money.

35
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,400
Give it your best, kid.

36
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:01,519
Come on.

37
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,519
Go get changed first.

38
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:06,120
(That's a good shot.)

39
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,159
(Underground Fight Club)
Make some room, everyone.

40
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,560
Thanks, everyone.

41
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,360
(Just like five years ago.)

42
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,360
(Stay loose.)

43
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,380
You've got this!

44
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,320
(Did you get that?)

45
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,000
(Nice one!)

46
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,760
(Don't hurt him too badly.)

47
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,479
Round one.

48
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,039
Ready.

49
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:26,879
Fight!

50
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,880
(Still showing off?)

51
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,640
(One punch! Send him home!)

52
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:38,800
(Come on!)

53
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:40,800
(What are your plans?)

54
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:41,680
(School?)

55
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,520
(Or do you want to learn a trade?)

56
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:46,800
(Before I got out,)

57
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,039
(I had a lot of things in mind.)

58
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:56,680
(Come on!)

59
00:02:59,199 --> 00:02:59,879
- One.
- (Come on!)

60
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:00,680
Two.

61
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,240
Three.

62
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:02,180
(Come on!)

63
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,000
Winner!

64
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:05,500
Yeah!

65
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:06,140
(Whoa!)

66
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,080
(Don't judge a book by its cover!)

67
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,319
(He's got skills!)

68
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,400
(Not bad!)

69
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:15,940
(Awesome!)

70
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,960
(Amazing! Amazing!)

71
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,599
(That was so cool!)

72
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,560
(Go! Go!)

73
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,680
(He's amazing!)

74
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,120
(Nice! Nice!)

75
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,520
Why so cocky?

76
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:47,400
Hey!

77
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,380
(Now this is a real match.)

78
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:57,120
(Dodge!)

79
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,479
Hey, time!

80
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:08,120
(He's done, right?)

81
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,840
Time!

82
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,759
(Keep fighting!)

83
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,759
- Are you trying to get yourself killed?
- (Get up!)

84
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,039
Foul. That's one warning.

85
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,560
If you can't beat him, just give up!

86
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:16,360
You'll get yourself killed!

87
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,319
One.

88
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,160
Why are you getting back up?

89
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,639
Two.

90
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,279
You can't beat him.

91
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:19,480
Three.

92
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,360
Just give up!

93
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,279
Four.

94
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,279
I won't quit.

95
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,319
Focus on his left side and left leg.

96
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:42,959
You good?

97
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,160
Let's go again.

98
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:46,879
(Come on!)

99
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:47,920
(Come on!)

100
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,639
(Push forward! Get him!)

101
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:50,240
(Come on!)

102
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,240
(Hit harder!)

103
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,079
Winner!

104
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:21,840
Yeah!

105
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,079
(Amazing!)

106
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:24,720
(That's amazing!)

107
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,160
You must be exhausted.

108
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:47,800
Have some water.

109
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,800
How come you're here?

110
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:49,720
Stop it.

111
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:54,120
Watch out!

112
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,120
Not mad anymore?

113
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:41,199
Since when was I mad?

114
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,639
Does it hurt?

115
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,720
Yeah.

116
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:51,839
It hurts.

117
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,680
Maybe you could kiss it better?

118
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,720
I heard saliva

119
00:06:59,079 --> 00:06:59,879
helps with swelling.

120
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,000
You sure know how to flirt.

121
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,800
So you were playing innocent before?

122
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:07,639
No.

123
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,839
I-I'm just really happy.

124
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,839
If it weren't for you, I...

125
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,000
I wouldn't have won.

126
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,120
Enough with the flattery.

127
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,000
Why are you fighting underground?

128
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:20,399
Is this how you plan to make a living?

129
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:21,920
Yes.

130
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,680
Sun and I want to open a boxing gym.

131
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:27,160
I started boxing when I was ten.

132
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,959
Sun was my coach.

133
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,480
Before I went in,

134
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,399
I won a junior championship.

135
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,480
I heard you got into trouble
protecting your mom.

136
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,800
What happened?

137
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:42,959
Su Yan.

138
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:45,399
You really don't remember any of it?

139
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,240
Remember what?

140
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:52,480
Nothing.

141
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,000
Do you want

142
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,079
to grab something to eat?

143
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,120
Are you hungry?

144
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:16,500
Well, well.

145
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,040
Now that's a feisty one.

146
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,680
Come have some fun with us,

147
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,000
and we'll let your boy toy go.

148
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,000
(Su Yan.)

149
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,520
(Tell me.)

150
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:29,280
(What would make you feel better?)

151
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:31,840
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

152
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:35,640
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

153
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:39,000
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

154
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:44,120
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

155
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:01,280
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

156
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:04,880
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

157
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:08,280
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

158
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:11,960
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

159
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:15,360
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

160
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:19,120
♪I hum this song alone♪

161
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:22,640
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

162
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:26,560
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

163
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:30,000
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

164
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,680
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

165
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:37,160
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

166
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:42,360
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
